# Universal Multi-Chain Bridge dApp

A production-style full-stack Web3 bridge dApp for transferring assets across Arc Network, Ethereum Sepolia, BNB Chain, Arbitrum, Linea, Base, and Polygon.

## Overview

This repository contains:

- `contracts/` – Solidity smart contract and Hardhat deployment scripts for the bridge, pause controls, and referral points logic.
- `frontend/` – Next.js + React + Tailwind + RainbowKit + Wagmi application with a baby pink Web3 UI, bridge widget, referral hub, analytics, and dashboard views.

## Features

- Multi-chain bridge interface with source/target network selectors
- EVM wallet connectivity via MetaMask / Wagmi / RainbowKit
- Dynamic fee and gas estimation UI
- Testnet faucet widget
- Referral engine with 10% lifetime bonus points
- Trade-to-earn point tracking
- Activity history and dashboards
- Global analytics cards
- Responsive glassmorphism UI in a soft baby pink, dark-themed design

